# Dirtree: Stateful directory trees in the CLI for humans and LLMs. https://github.com/pmarreck/dirtree
ver=1.2
depth=2
max_lines=80

annotate=[
	DESIGN.md = Design doc: includes event-level correction stream rationale and per-stream storage economics.
	LEARNINGS.md = Session learnings including token-level residual requirement and environment/build observations.
	PLAN.md = Running checklist: includes token/event correction stream and storage economics tasks.
	README.md = Public overview: current status, blar/difz role, build commands, CLI surface.
	SESSION_RESUME.md = Live handoff: latest private-corpus signal, 100% first-200 mixed ZIP-family coverage, and remaining xlsx worksheet gap.
	cli/main.c = C CLI dogfooding the FFI; identify/help/about implemented, reproduce/list pending.
	docs/DEFLATE_DIALS.md = Catalog of DEFLATE dials that create valid but byte-distinct streams.
	docs/ENCODER_NOTES.md = Append-only empirical findings by encoder/probe; confirmed behavior lives here.
	docs/PRIOR_ART.md = Prior-art notes: precomp/preflate/preflate-rs/grittibanzli/reflate lessons, licenses, and difz bit-mode role.
	docs/V0.1_STATUS.md = Older v0.1 checkpoint; may lag current registry/test counts, consult README and SESSION_RESUME for latest.
	include/deflate_fingerprint.h = Public C FFI header including identify, registry encode, and explicit FlushEvent config encode.
	src/bitstream.zig = LSB-first DEFLATE BitWriter and fixed-Huffman primitive emit helpers.
	src/blocks.zig = DEFLATE block cost model, stored/fixed/dynamic emitters, raw-slice-aware multi-block dispatch helpers.
	src/encoder.zig = Parameterized DEFLATE encoders; includes zlib L6 memLevel 6/7/9 variants, Info-ZIP-style 4096-symbol profitability flushes, and configured flush/final marker reproduction.
	src/fidelity.zig = Test-only real-zlib oracle via @cImport(zlib.h) for byte-exact fidelity checks.
	src/huffman.zig = zlib-compatible Huffman tree builder, canonical codes, and code-length RLE.
	src/inspect.zig = Pure DEFLATE inspector: block ranges, observed flush schedules, and token traces for LZ77 divergence analysis.
	src/lib.zig = Public API/FFI and fingerprint registry; IDs 29-32 cover zlib L6 memLevel variants and Info-ZIP-style profitability flushes.
	src/match.zig = LZ77 tokenizers and zlib-style params; memLevel adjustment caps hash_bits at 15 while pending buffer size varies separately.
	src/ooxml.zig = OOXML docProps/app.xml metadata parser for producer/version clustering.
	src/png.zig = PNG IDAT parser: concatenates chunks, validates zlib header, exposes raw RFC1951 body and wrapper metadata.
	tests/integration/fixtures/extract_zip_deflate.c = Tiny ZIP32 test helper that extracts the first method=8 raw DEFLATE payload from generator-oracle ZIP archives.
	tests/integration/fixtures/gen_png_idat.c = Fixture generator: emits tiny PNG-like file with deterministic zlib-wrapped IDAT stream.
	tests/integration/infozip_roundtrip.sh = Integration test: generates Info-ZIP zip -6 fixtures and asserts raw method=8 streams identify as fingerprint #32.
	tests/integration/png_probe.sh = Integration test: generated PNG-like fixture exercises png-corpus-probe against IDAT zlib data.
	tools/deflate_block_inspect.zig = Dev tool: prints raw-DEFLATE block boundaries using src/inspect.zig.
	tools/excel_candidate_probe.zig = Dev probe: compares Excel worksheet DEFLATE hypotheses, sweeps fast params, reports token divergence, and tests row-chunk flush topology.
	tools/png_corpus_probe.zig = PNG corpus probe: extracts IDAT raw DEFLATE, inflates PNG-filtered bytes, runs fingerprint/config identification, and summarizes sanitized miss block features.
	tools/zip_corpus_probe.zig = ZIP-family corpus probe: extracts method=8 streams, reports fingerprints, OOXML metadata, miss block shapes, and optional Excel worksheet cluster coverage.
]
